# Spike 18 demo, played: a commander-only start. After the title card (3 s):
# select the commander (its tile, beside the headquarters'), have it build
# the first factory, queue an engineer there, and warp the commander home.
at 3.5 drag 450,200 1150,700            # the commander and the headquarters
at 3.8 click 60,750                     # the commander's tile: only it
at 4.0 expect selected == 1
at 4.5 shot start
at 5.2 key V                            # the build tab
at 5.5 key Q                            # a factory
at 5.8 move 900,470
at 6.3 shot placing
at 6.6 click 900,470
at 6.8 expect sent build == 1
at 9.0 shot building
at 24.0 shot built
at 24.5 click 900,470                   # the factory
at 24.8 expect selected == 1
at 25.2 key A                           # an engineer
at 25.4 expect sent produce == 1
at 25.8 shot factory
at 26.5 drag 450,200 1150,700
at 26.8 click 60,750                    # the commander again
at 27.2 key U                           # warp home
at 27.4 expect sent warp == 1
at 29.0 shot warping
at 38.5 shot home
at 39.0 quit
